\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Per-column missing rate in the raw corpus (representative subset). Shade encodes the missing rate; hatched tiles were dropped (all above the $70\%$ threshold). Three of the five dropped fields are shown for illustration; the two others, \texttt  {position\_in\_siblings} ($93.1\%$) and \texttt  {previous\_health\_condition} ($91.3\%$), are omitted for space. Geolocation and weather fields ($\sim $53\%) were first partially recovered from external sources before imputation. ``Separation'' abbreviates duration-of-separation.}}{3}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
